.9mm pixel pitch delivers sharp 4K content outdoors. IP65 rated with automatic rain detection \\u2014 the screen retracts automatically if it starts raining. Designed for luxury villas, superyachts, and premium hospitality venues.\", \"sku\": \"BL-HC-PVR29\", \"brand\": {\"@type\": \"Brand\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\"}, \"manufacturer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/poolview-retractable-p29\", \"category\": \"home-cinema\", \"image\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/brightluxx/site-images/prod_poolview-retractable-p29.webp\", \"offers\": {\"@type\": \"AggregateOffer\", \"priceCurrency\": \"USD\", \"lowPrice\": 8000, \"highPrice\": 80000, \"offerCount\": 1, \"availability\": \"https://schema.org/InStock\", \"seller\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://files.ihgbrands.com/uploads_hero_banner.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/poolview-retractable-p29\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"2.9mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"4500 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch and how does it affect image quality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The PoolView Retractable features a 2.9mm pixel pitch, which ensures sharp and clear 4K resolution content outdoors, ideal for detailed visuals even at closer viewing distances.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the PoolView Retractable suitable for outdoor environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is IP65 rated, providing full protection against dust and water jets, making it highly durable and weather-resistant for outdoor use.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the motorized retractable mechanism work?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The screen rises smoothly from a concealed housing with a whisper-quiet motorized lift system operating under 35dB, and it automatically retracts when not in use or in rain to protect the display.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the screen detect rain automatically?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it includes an automatic rain sensor that triggers the screen to retract immediately when rain is detected, ensuring the screen\\u2019s protection without manual intervention.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What sizes are available for the PoolView Retractable P2.9?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The screen comes in 85\\\", 100\\\", and 120\\\" sizes to fit various outdoor spaces, providing flexibility depending on your viewing needs and installation environment.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and after-sales support does Brightluxx provide?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers industry-standard warranty terms on the PoolView Retractable, typically covering parts and labor, along with dedicated after-sales technical support to ensure optimal performance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this screen compare to traditional projector setups for outdoor cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike projectors, the PoolView Retractable offers superior brightness at 4500 nits and sharper resolution with 2.9mm pixel pitch, providing vivid images even in daylight without requiring a dark environment.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is professional installation required for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, due to its motorized retractable mechanism and weatherproof housing, professional installation is recommended to ensure safety, durability, and optimal performance.\"}}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Home\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Products\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"PoolView Retractable P2.9\", \"item\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/poolview-retractable-p29\"}]}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"Organization\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx\", \"legalName\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"logo\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"contactPoint\": {\"@type\": \"ContactPoint\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"contactType\": \"sales\", \"areaServed\": [\"AE\", \"SA\", \"QA\", \"KW\", \"BH\", \"OM\"], \"availableLanguage\": [\"en\", \"ar\"]}}</script><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"LocalBusiness\", \"@id\": \"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\", \"name\": \"Brightluxx LED Displays\", \"image\": \"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\", \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com\", \"telephone\": \"+971559954274\", \"priceRange\": \"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\u00b2\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"streetAddress\": \"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\", \"addressLocality\": \"Dubai\", \"addressCountry\": \"AE\"}, \"geo\": {\"@type\": \"GeoCoordinates\", \"latitude\": 24.9857, \"longitude\": 55.0272}, \"openingHoursSpecification\": {\"@type\": \"OpeningHoursSpecification\", \"dayOfWeek\": [\"Monday\", \"Tuesday\", \"Wednesday\", \"Thursday\", \"Friday\", \"Saturday\"], \"opens\": \"09:00\", \"closes\": \"18:00\"}, \"areaServed\": [\"Dubai\", \"Abu Dhabi\", \"United Arab Emirates\", \"Saudi Arabia\", \"Qatar\", \"Kuwait\", \"Bahrain\", \"Oman\"]}</script><div><h1>PoolView Retractable P2.9</h1><p>Discover PoolView Retractable P2.9, premium LED display in Dubai. Perfect for poolsides. Contact Brightluxx UAE for a custom solution today!</p><p><strong>Motorized retractable LED screen for seamless outdoor living.</strong></p><p>The PoolView Retractable rises from a concealed housing when you want to watch, and disappears completely when you don't. Motorized lift system with whisper-quiet operation (under 35dB). Fine 2.9mm pixel pitch delivers sharp 4K content outdoors. IP65 rated with automatic rain detection — the screen retracts automatically if it starts raining. Designed for luxury villas, superyachts, and premium hospitality venues.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch and how does it affect image quality?</h3><p>The PoolView Retractable features a 2.9mm pixel pitch, which ensures sharp and clear 4K resolution content outdoors, ideal for detailed visuals even at closer viewing distances.</p><h3>Is the PoolView Retractable suitable for outdoor environments?</h3><p>Yes, it is IP65 rated, providing full protection against dust and water jets, making it highly durable and weather-resistant for outdoor use.</p><h3>How does the motorized retractable mechanism work?</h3><p>The screen rises smoothly from a concealed housing with a whisper-quiet motorized lift system operating under 35dB, and it automatically retracts when not in use or in rain to protect the display.</p><h3>Can the screen detect rain automatically?</h3><p>Yes, it includes an automatic rain sensor that triggers the screen to retract immediately when rain is detected, ensuring the screen’s protection without manual intervention.</p></div></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/310vm2bl3xxpt.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[31262,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"PageViewTracker\\\"]\\n3:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n4:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n6:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"OutletBoundary\\\"]\\n7:\\\"$Sreact.suspense\\\"\\na:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"ViewportBoundary\\\"]\\nc:I[97367,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"MetadataBoundary\\\"]\\ne:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\",1]\\n:HL[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"style\\\"]\\n9:X\\n0:{\\\"P\\\":null,\\\"c\\\":[\\\"\\\",\\\"products\\\",\\\"poolview-retractable-p29\\\"],\\\"q\\\":\\\"\\\",\\\"i\\\":false,\\\"f\\\":[[[\\\"\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[\\\"slug\\\",\\\"products/poolview-retractable-p29\\\",\\\"c\\\",[\\\"products\\\"]],{\\\"children\\\":[\\\"__PAGE__\\\",{},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4608]},\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"$undefined\\\",4624],[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"$1\\\",\\\"c\\\",{\\\"children\\\":[[[\\\"$\\\",\\\"link\\\",\\\"0\\\",{\\\"rel\\\":\\\"stylesheet\\\",\\\"href\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\\\",\\\"precedence\\\":\\\"next\\\",\\\"crossOrigin\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\",\\\"nonce\\\":\\\"$undefined\\\"}],[\\\"$\\\",\\\"script\\\",\\\"script-0\\\",{\\\"src\\\":\\\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\\\",\\\"async\\\":true,\\\"nonce\\\":\