etractable-p29\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"2.9mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"4500 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Ta62,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch and how does it affect image quality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The PoolView Retractable features a 2.9mm pixel pitch, which ensures sharp and clear 4K resolution content outdoors, ideal for detailed visuals even at closer viewing distances.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the PoolView Retractable suitable for outdoor environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is IP65 rated, providing full protection against dust and water jets, making it highly durable and weather-resistant for outdoor use.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the motorized retractable mechanism work?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The screen rises smoothly from a concealed housing with a whisper-quiet motorized lift system operating under 35dB, and it automatically retracts when not in use or in rain to protect the display.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the screen detect rain automatically?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it includes an automatic rain sensor that triggers the screen to retract immediately when rain is detected, ensuring the screen\\u2019s protection without manual intervention.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What sizes are available for the PoolView Retractable P2.9?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The screen comes in 85\\\", 100\\\", and 120\\\" sizes to fit various outdoor spaces, providing flexibility depending on your viewing needs and installation environment.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What warranty and after-sales support does Brightluxx provide?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Brightluxx offers industry-standard warranty terms on the PoolView Retractable, typically covering parts and labor, along with dedicated after-sales technical support to ensure optimal performance.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does this screen compare to traditional projector setups for outdoor cinema?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Unlike projectors, the PoolView Retractable offers superior brightness at 4500 nits and sharper resolution with 2.9mm pixel pitch, providing vivid images even in daylight without requiring a dark environment.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is professional installation required for this product?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, due to its motorized retractable mechanism and weatherproof housing, professional installation is recommended to ensure safety, durability, and optimal performance.\"}}]}5:[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"data-testid\":\"next-server-rendered-parity-page\",\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"script\",\"0\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$f\"}}],[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$10\"}}],\"$L11\",\"$L12\",\"$L13\"],\"$L14\"]}]\n11:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"BreadcrumbList\\\", \\\"itemListElement\\\": [{\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 1, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Home\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 2, \\\"name\\\": \\\"Products\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products\\\"}, {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ListItem\\\", \\\"position\\\": 3, \\\"name\\\": \\\"PoolView Retractable P2.9\\\", \\\"item\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/products/poolview-retractable-p29\\\"}]}\"}}]\n12:[\"$\",\"script\",\"3\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"Organization\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#organization\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx\\\", \\\"legalName\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"logo\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"contactPoint\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"ContactPoint\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"contactType\\\": \\\"sales\\\", \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"AE\\\", \\\"SA\\\", \\\"QA\\\", \\\"KW\\\", \\\"BH\\\", \\\"OM\\\"], \\\"availableLanguage\\\": [\\\"en\\\", \\\"ar\\\"]}}\"}}]\n13:[\"$\",\"script\",\"4\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\": \\\"https://schema.org\\\", \\\"@type\\\": \\\"LocalBusiness\\\", \\\"@id\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/#localbusiness\\\", \\\"name\\\": \\\"Brightluxx LED Displays\\\", \\\"image\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com/android-chrome-512x512.png\\\", \\\"url\\\": \\\"https://brightluxx.com\\\", \\\"telephone\\\": \\\"+971559954274\\\", \\\"priceRange\\\": \\\"AED 2,500 - AED 12,000 per m\\\\u00b2\\\", \\\"address\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"PostalAddress\\\", \\\"streetAddress\\\": \\\"Jebel Ali Industrial Area 1\\\", \\\"addressLocality\\\": \\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"addressCountry\\\": \\\"AE\\\"}, \\\"geo\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"GeoCoordinates\\\", \\\"latitude\\\": 24.9857, \\\"longitude\\\": 55.0272}, \\\"openingHoursSpecification\\\": {\\\"@type\\\": \\\"OpeningHoursSpecification\\\", \\\"dayOfWeek\\\": [\\\"Monday\\\", \\\"Tuesday\\\", \\\"Wednesday\\\", \\\"Thursday\\\", \\\"Friday\\\", \\\"Saturday\\\"], \\\"opens\\\": \\\"09:00\\\", \\\"closes\\\": \\\"18:00\\\"}, \\\"areaServed\\\": [\\\"Dubai\\\", \\\"Abu Dhabi\\\", \\\"United Arab Emirates\\\", \\\"Saudi Arabia\\\", \\\"Qatar\\\", \\\"Kuwait\\\", \\\"Bahrain\\\", \\\"Oman\\\"]}\"}}]\n15:T688,<h1>PoolView Retractable P2.9</h1><p>Discover PoolView Retractable P2.9, premium LED display in Dubai. Perfect for poolsides. Contact Brightluxx UAE for a custom solution today!</p><p><strong>Motorized retractable LED screen for seamless outdoor living.</strong></p><p>The PoolView Retractable rises from a concealed housing when you want to watch, and disappears completely when you don't. Motorized lift system with whisper-quiet operation (under 35dB). Fine 2.9mm pixel pitch delivers sharp 4K content outdoors. IP65 rated with automatic rain detection — the screen retracts automatically if it starts raining. Designed for luxury villas, superyachts, and premium hospitality venues.</p><h2>FAQ</h2><h3>What is the pixel pitch and how does it affect image quality?</h3><p>The PoolView Retractable features a 2.9mm pixel pitch, which ensures sharp and clear 4K resolution content outdoors, ideal for detailed visuals even at closer viewing distances.</p><h3>Is the PoolView Retractable suitable for outdoor environments?</h3><p>Yes, it is IP65 rated, providing full protection against dust and water jets, making it highly durable and weather-resistant for outdoor use.</p><h3>How does the motorized retractable mechanism work?</h3><p>The screen rises smoothly from a concealed housing with a whisper-quiet motorized lift system operating under 35dB, and it automatically retracts when not in use or in rain to protect the display.</p><h3>Can the screen detect rain automatically?</h3><p>Yes, it includes an automatic rain sensor that triggers the screen to retract immediately when rain is detected, ensuring the screen’s protection without manual intervention.</p>14:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$15\"}}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n8:null\nd:[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"PoolView Retractable P2.9 LED Screen | Brightluxx Dubai\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Discover PoolView Retractable P2.9, premium LED display in Dubai. Perfect for poolsides. Contact Brightluxx UAE for a custom solution today!\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://brightluxx.com/products/poolview-retractable-p29\"}]]\n","segmentData":{"/_tree":":HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n0:{\"tree\":{\"name\":\"\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4176,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"slug\",\"param\":{\"type\":\"c\",\"key\":\"products/poolview-retractable-p29\",\"siblings\":[\"products\"]},\"prefetchHints\":4192,\"slots\":{\"children\":{\"name\":\"__PAGE__\",\"param\":null,\"prefetchHints\":4256,\"slots\":null}}}}},\"staleTime\":300,\"buildId\":\"0VevTopRFbkV79u5_PhIJ\"}\n","/_full":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n2:I[31262,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"PageViewTracker\"]\n3:I[39756,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n4:I[37457,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\"]\n6:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"OutletBoundary\"]\n7:\"$Sreact.suspense\"\na:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"ViewportBoundary\"]\nc:I[97367,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"MetadataBoundary\"]\ne:I[68027,[\"/_next/static/chunks/3hgc05_1jtbhm.js\"],\"default\",1]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/chunks/2xf3yuf2jb148.css\",\"style\"]\n9:X\n0:{\"P\":null,\"c\":[\"\",\"products\",\"poolview-retractable-p29\"],\"q\":\"\",\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"c