er.webp\"}, \"url\": \"https://brightluxx.com/products/poolview-retractable-p29\"}, \"additionalProperty\": [{\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Pixel Pitch\", \"value\": \"2.9mm\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Brightness\", \"value\": \"4500 nits\"}, {\"@type\": \"PropertyValue\", \"name\": \"Warranty\", \"value\": \"3 Years Standard | 5 Years Extended Available\"}]}10:Ta62,{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What is the pixel pitch and how does it affect image quality?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The PoolView Retractable features a 2.9mm pixel pitch, which ensures sharp and clear 4K resolution content outdoors, ideal for detailed visuals even at closer viewing distances.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Is the PoolView Retractable suitable for outdoor environments?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it is IP65 rated, providing full protection against dust and water jets, making it highly durable and weather-resistant for outdoor use.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"How does the motorized retractable mechanism work?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The screen rises smoothly from a concealed housing with a whisper-quiet motorized lift system operating under 35dB, and it automatically retracts when not in use or in rain to protect the display.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Can the screen detect rain automatically?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Yes, it includes an automatic rain sensor that triggers the screen to retract immediately when rain is detected, ensuring the screen\\u2019s protection without manual intervention.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"What sizes are available for the PoolView Retractable P2.9?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"The screen comes in 85\\\", 100\\\", an